{#
    The seasons index — option 6C.

    Every season as a card, so switching season is navigation rather than a
    control. 6A's previous/next stepper and 6B's heading-as-disclosure were
    weighed and not taken; the accepted cost of this one is that switching is
    two taps, every time, permanently. What it buys is that nothing has to
    change later — an index only improves as seasons accumulate — and that the
    leaderboard stays completely free of scope chrome, which is what 5C was
    arguing for.

    **League points appear on a season card and nowhere above it.** They are
    season-specific and are never summed across seasons, so this page has no
    total of its own and offers no all-time table. The archive and the records
    board are the all-time destinations, and they are match-derived.
#}
{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}Seasons | Malta Beyblade Community League{% endblock %}

{% block body %}

    <twig:BackLink href="{{ path('app_league_proposal_v2') }}" class="mb-6">Return to league framework</twig:BackLink>

    <twig:PageHeader
        eyebrow="Every season"
        title="Malta Beyblade"
        highlight="seasons"
        size="md"
    >
        Points are season-specific and are never added across seasons, so each of these is its own table.
    </twig:PageHeader>

    <twig:Flashes />

    {% if cards is not empty %}
        <div class="mb-8 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2" data-page-section="seasons">
            {% for card in cards %}
                <twig:SeasonIndex :card="card" />
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    {% else %}
        <div class="mb-8" data-page-section="seasons-empty">
            <twig:EmptyState icon="🗓️" title="No seasons yet">
                The league has not opened a season, so there is nothing to list.
            </twig:EmptyState>
        </div>
    {% endif %}

    {# The genuinely all-time views, which are match-derived rather than
       scored — the only kind that can span seasons honestly. #}
    <twig:Card data-page-section="all-time">
        <twig:SectionHeading title="All-time, without adding points up" size="sm" tone="neutral" />
        <p class="mb-4 text-xs text-ink-muted">
            Both of these read every archived tournament across every season, unranked events
            included. They are match-derived, which is the only kind of figure that can span
            seasons honestly.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
            <twig:Button href="{{ path('tournament_archive') }}" tone="neutral" class="w-full sm:w-auto">
                Tournament archive &rarr;
            </twig:Button>
            <twig:Button href="{{ path('records_board') }}" tone="neutral" class="w-full sm:w-auto">
                League records &rarr;
            </twig:Button>
        </div>
    </twig:Card>

{% endblock %}
